    "name": "Oracle WebLogic Server Oracle WebLogic Monitoring and\u2026",
    "description": "RESTful API for accessing runtime monitoring data, diagnostics information, and performance metrics for Oracle WebLogic Server domains. Provides read-only access to the domainRuntime and serverRuntime bean trees for monitoring server states, application runtimes, JDBC data source health, JMS statistics, thread pool utilization, and server lifecycle management operations.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Oracle Support",
